hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1251","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas zibah karnay ka janwar ho jisay wo zibah karay ga, phir jab Zilhajja ka chaand nazar aa jaye to wo apne baalon aur apne nakhunon mein se kuch na le yahan tak ke qurbani karay. (Muslim: 6/83). Baab: Wo waqt jis mein qurbani zibah ki jaye."
"1252","[AI-translation] Jundub bin Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Eid-ul-Azha mein haazir hua. Aap ne namaz padhnay aur apni namaz se farigh honay ke siwa kuch na kiya tha ke Aap ne salam phera, phir Aap ne qurbaniyon ka gosht dekha jo Aap ki namaz se farigh honay se pehle zibah ki gayi thin. To Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne apni qurbani namaz padhnay se pehle zibah ki, ya ham namaz padhein, to wo us ki jagah doosri zibah karay, aur jis ne zibah nahi ki to wo Allah ke naam se zibah karay. (Muslim: 6/73). Baab: Jo qurbani namaz se pehle zibah karay us ki (qurbani) kaafi nahi."
"1253","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehle jo ham apne is din mein kartay hain wo ye hai ke ham namaz padhtay hain, phir wapas ja kar qurbani kartay hain. To jo aisa karay us ne hamari sunnat ko paya, aur jo zibah karay to wo sirf gosht hai jo us ne apne ghar walon ke liye pehle tayyar kiya, wo qurbani mein se kuch nahi. Aur Abu Burda bin Niyar (raziyallahu anhu) ne zibah kar diya tha. To unhon ne kaha: Mere paas jaza hai jo musinna se behtar hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Usay zibah karo, aur wo tumharay baad kisi ke liye kaafi na hogi. (Muslim: 6/75). Baab: Qurbaniyon mein se umar mein kya jaaiz hai. (Jaza Bakra Eid wali bakri ya dumba hai jo aik saal se kam ho; musinna do daanton wala janwar hai jo teesray saal mein dakhil ho.)"
"1254","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musinna ke siwa zibah na karo, siwae is ke ke tum par mushkil ho to dumba ka jaza zibah karo. (Muslim: 6/77). (Aik riwayat ke izafay mein hai ke bakri mein se; jaza bakri, dumba, gaaye mein wo hai jis ka aik saal poora ho; ye hadees Abu Zubair ne Jabir se mu'anan riwayat ki hai, aur ghair musinna jaza ki qurbani ka jawaz ghair aik hadees mein sahih hua hai.)"
"1255","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham mein qurbaniyan taqseem keen. To mujhe jaza mila. Aik riwayat mein hai ke ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath dumba ke jaza ki qurbani ki. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak mujhe jaza mila hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ki qurbani karo. (Muslim: 6/77). Baab: Do seengon walay chitkabray maindhon ki qurbani mustahab hona, haath se zibah karna, tasmiya aur takbeer."
"1256","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do chitkabray seengon walay maindhon ki qurbani ki. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Aap ko apne haath se unhein zibah kartay dekha, aur main ne Aap ko un ke pehluon par apna qadam rakhtay dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne tasmiya aur takbeer kahi. (Muslim: 6/77-78). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka apni taraf se, apne ghar walon aur apni ummat ki taraf se qurbani zibah karna."
"1257","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne seengon walay maindhay ka hukm diya jo siyah mein chalta, siyah mein baithta aur siyah mein dekhta, yani us ke paon, pait aur aankhein siyah thin. To wo qurbani ke liye laya gaya. To Aap ne us se farmaya: Ae Aisha! Chhuri lao. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Usay pathar se tez karo. To us ne aisa kiya. Phir Aap ne usay liya aur maindha liya aur usay lita diya, phir usay zibah kiya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke naam se, Ae Allah! Muhammad, Aal-e-Muhammad aur Ummat-e-Muhammad ki taraf se qabool farma. Phir us ki qurbani ki. (Muslim: 6/78). Baab: Teen ke baad qurbaniyon ka gosht khanay se mumaniat."
"1258","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid, Ibn Azhar ke azaad kardah, se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath Eid mein shirkat ki. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath namaz padhi. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne hamein khutbay se pehle namaz padhayi, phir logon ko khutba diya aur kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhein teen raaton se zyada apni qurbaniyon ka gosht khanay se mana kiya hai, to na khao. Muslim mein hai ke phir na khao. (Muslim: 6/79). Baab: Teen ke baad qurbaniyon ke gosht mein ijazat, jama karna, tosha banana aur sadqa jaaiz hona."
"1259","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Bakr se, Abdullah bin Waqid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qurbaniyon ka gosht teen ke baad khanay se mana farmaya. Abdullah bin Abu Bakr ne kaha: To main ne ye Amra se zikr kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha. Main ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ko kehtay hue suna: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein dehat ke gharon walon mein se kuch log Eid-ul-Azha ke mauqay par aaye. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Teen (din) jama karo, phir jo bachay usay sadqa karo. Phir us ke baad unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak log apni qurbaniyon se mashkizein banatay thay aur charbi pighlatay thay. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ab kya hua? Logon ne kaha: Aap ne qurbaniyon ka gosht teen ke baad khanay se mana farmaya tha. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein un mohtaj logon ki wajah se mana tha jo us waqt aaye thay. Ab khao, jama karo aur sadqa karo. (Muslim). (Aik riwayat mein Uqba se hai ke ham ne Rasoolullah ke saath dumba ke jaza ki qurbani ki.)"
"1260","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Na fara hai aur na ateera. Ibn Rafi ne apni riwayat mein izafa kiya ke fara pehli paidaish hai jo un ke liye paida hoti to wo usay zibah kartay thay. (Muslim: 6/83). Baab: Jo ghairullah ke liye zibah karay. (Bukhari ke lafz hain ke wo unhein apne buton ke liye zibah kartay thay, aur ateera Rajab mein hoti hai; ye tafseer qail se hai.)"
"1261","[AI-translation] Abut Tufail Amir bin Wasila se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ali bin Abu Talib ke paas tha ke un ke paas aik mard aaya aur kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tum se kya poshida baat kehtay thay? Unhon ne kaha: To wo ghussa hue aur kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujh se koi poshida baat nahi kehtay thay jo logon se chupatay hon, siwae is ke ke unhon ne mujhe chaar kalimay bataye thay. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Wo kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Allah us par lanat karay jo apne walid par lanat karay, aur Allah us par lanat karay jo ghairullah ke liye zibah karay, aur Allah us par lanat karay jo bidati ko panah de, aur Allah us par lanat karay jo zameen ke nishan badal de. (Muslim: 6/84)"
